The contents of custom_components/sleepiq/ are derived from
homeassistant/components/sleepiq/ at tag 2026.8.2. The per-file SHA-256 hashes
of that baseline are recorded in docs/UPSTREAM-BASELINE.txt, where each file
this project edits is marked `modified`.

Files added by this project, with no upstream counterpart:

  * massage.py         - massage state model and control
  * diagnostics.py     - diagnostics download
  * quality_scale.yaml - Integration Quality Scale record
  * translations/      - runtime translations (a copy of strings.json)

Modifications by this project, relative to that baseline:

  * __init__.py    - build massage objects during setup, translated setup
                     exceptions, migration of massage unique ids
  * config_flow.py - masked password selector on the user and reauth forms
  * const.py       - massage entity type constants
  * coordinator.py - fetch massage state on each refresh, translated poll
                     exceptions, login failure raised as ConfigEntryAuthFailed
  * select.py      - massage mode and head/foot speed select entities,
                     PARALLEL_UPDATES
  * number.py      - massage timer number entity, PARALLEL_UPDATES
  * strings.json   - massage translations, field descriptions, exception
                     messages; core-only [%key:...] references replaced with
                     literals, which do not resolve outside core
  * icons.json     - massage icons
  * manifest.json  - custom component identity and version
